==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Quaxly|50}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*'''Splashing Dodge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Magikarp|32}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

